  <h2>Whoever you see, the standard holds</h2>
  <p>Here's a fair worry about any group practice: will I get the founder, or a junior therapist I've never heard of? Our answer is built into how we work. Kay personally trains and supervises every associate, the same way she trained a generation of therapists at Pepperdine. So the care isn't Kay-or-nothing; it's the same relationship-first standard whether you see her or one of the team. The free call is where we match you to the right person for what you're carrying.</p>
